    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a dev with a unique vision - &quot;To create the best darn ghost hunting/investigating simulation on Steam!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So dive into a world that's deep with lore, gadgets and ... oh yeah... Ghosts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the Whispers \u2013 Provocation is a first-person single player \u201cAuthentic Real-Life Paranormal Investigation Simulator&quot;. It's not a game looking to Jump Scare you (although it may happen so don't blink!), instead it's about truly learning about a haunted family and their past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/9b7ca9e50844e8a1e2d762c2e2146e92.poster.avif?t=1748526745\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/9b7ca9e50844e8a1e2d762c2e2146e92.webm?t=1748526745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/9b7ca9e50844e8a1e2d762c2e2146e92.mp4?t=1748526745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Operate tools paranormal investigators use in real life to learn about the ghosts that plague this location and what binds them here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/d403bdb875df548e0f6f97991f35e7ef.poster.avif?t=1748526745\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/d403bdb875df548e0f6f97991f35e7ef.webm?t=1748526745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/d403bdb875df548e0f6f97991f35e7ef.mp4?t=1748526745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use provocations to coax the dead in various ways to communicate or manifest. However, beware, trying to provoke a ghost while unprepared can lead to psychological consequences that could make the investigation harder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So keep your nerves calm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/e095d47d206a739e029c4e6bab9dd128.poster.avif?t=1748526745\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/e095d47d206a739e029c4e6bab9dd128.webm?t=1748526745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/e095d47d206a739e029c4e6bab9dd128.mp4?t=1748526745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you dare, explore this enormous four-story mansion with over 30 rooms to learn about the dark secrets it has been hiding for generations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the clues to slowly piece together the sinful past this family has endured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for all the support with my previous work on Conrad Stevenson! I hope this game shows you that I've been hard at work with stronger gameplay, better visuals, and deeper investigations! ~ Kip the dev</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a dev with a unique vision - &quot;To create the best darn ghost hunting/investigating simulation on Steam!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So dive into a world that's deep with lore, gadgets and ... oh yeah... Ghosts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the Whispers \u2013 Provocation is a first-person single player \u201cAuthentic Real-Life Paranormal Investigation Simulator&quot;. It's not a game looking to Jump Scare you (although it may happen so don't blink!), instead it's about truly learning about a haunted family and their past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/9b7ca9e50844e8a1e2d762c2e2146e92.poster.avif?t=1748526745\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/9b7ca9e50844e8a1e2d762c2e2146e92.webm?t=1748526745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/9b7ca9e50844e8a1e2d762c2e2146e92.mp4?t=1748526745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Operate tools paranormal investigators use in real life to learn about the ghosts that plague this location and what binds them here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/d403bdb875df548e0f6f97991f35e7ef.poster.avif?t=1748526745\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/d403bdb875df548e0f6f97991f35e7ef.webm?t=1748526745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/d403bdb875df548e0f6f97991f35e7ef.mp4?t=1748526745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use provocations to coax the dead in various ways to communicate or manifest. However, beware, trying to provoke a ghost while unprepared can lead to psychological consequences that could make the investigation harder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So keep your nerves calm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/e095d47d206a739e029c4e6bab9dd128.poster.avif?t=1748526745\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/e095d47d206a739e029c4e6bab9dd128.webm?t=1748526745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/e095d47d206a739e029c4e6bab9dd128.mp4?t=1748526745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you dare, explore this enormous four-story mansion with over 30 rooms to learn about the dark secrets it has been hiding for generations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the clues to slowly piece together the sinful past this family has endured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for all the support with my previous work on Conrad Stevenson! I hope this game shows you that I've been hard at work with stronger gameplay, better visuals, and deeper investigations! ~ Kip the dev</p>",
    "short_description": "Tired of PHASMO-clones and Walking-sims? Me too, I made this ghost investigation sim to bring a new take to the genre. Research the family\u2019s history, learn their stories, use essential paranormal tools, and release them into the afterlife. With deep replayability.",
